span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-VRDMR-p17-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-VRDMR-p17_4-0\">4.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-VRDMR-p17_4-1\">4.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jim_Butler\" title=\"Jim Butler\">Jim Butler</a> (1996). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Vilhon_Reach_(sourcebook)\" title=\"The Vilhon Reach (sourcebook)\">The Vilhon Reach</a> (Dungeon Master's Guide)</i>. (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 17. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-0400-3\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-0400-3\">0-7869-0400-3</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-VRDMR-p4-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-VRDMR-p4_5-0\">5.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-VRDMR-p4_5-1\">5.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jim_Butler\" title=\"Jim Butler\">Jim Butler</a> (1996). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Vilhon_Reach_(sourcebook)\" title=\"The Vilhon Reach (sourcebook)\">The Vilhon Reach</a> (Dungeon Master's Guide)</i>. (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 4. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-0400-3\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-0400-3\">0-7869-0400-3</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-W+RoR-p66-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-W+RoR-p66_6-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/William_W._Connors\" title=\"William W. Connors\">William W. Connors</a> (November 1995). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_and_Rogues_of_the_Realms\" title=\"Wizards and Rogues of the Realms\">Wizards and Rogues of the Realms</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Anne_Gray_McCready\" title=\"Anne Gray McCready\">Anne Gray McCready</a>. (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 66. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-0190-X\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-01